{"title":"Career Roadmap · M&A Associate","role":"M&A Associate","summary":"An M&A (Mergers & Acquisitions) Associate is a corporate lawyer who supports transactions involving the acquisition, sale, merger, restructuring or investment in businesses.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Corporate Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An M&A (Mergers & Acquisitions) Associate is a corporate lawyer who supports transactions involving the acquisition, sale, merger, restructuring or investment in businesses."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Contract drafting"},{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Securities/regulatory awareness"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Transaction structuring"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Financial and commercial understanding"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"M&A lawyers may work at law firms, investment banks, private equity/venture capital firms, large corporate legal departments and specialized transaction practices."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Transaction Lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Client Objective","Transaction Structuring","Term Sheet / LOI","Legal Due Diligence","Risk Identification","Negotiation","Transaction Documents","Regulatory / Corporate Approvals","Signing","Closing","Post-Closing Obligations"]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Law Degree","Corporate Law Foundation","Corporate/M&A Internships","Transaction-Focused Internship / Pre-Placement","Junior Corporate Associate","M&A Associate","Senior Associate","Managing Associate / Counsel","Partner / General Counsel / Transaction Leader"]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-focused practice, students should also understand the regulatory environment surrounding co