bligation tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Virtual Data Rooms"},{"type":"p","text":"Secure digital transaction environments."},{"type":"h","text":"Legal Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Using transaction and legal data to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deal trends"},{"text":"Contract risks"},{"text":"Litigation exposure"},{"text":"Regulatory patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Blockchain"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital assets"},{"text":"Tokenized securities"},{"text":"Smart contracts"},{"text":"Digital ownership records"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong M&A candidate should graduate with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Securities law"},{"text":"Competition law"},{"text":"Insolvency awareness"},{"text":"Foreign investment awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Drafting"},{"text":"Transaction structuring"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Closing mechanics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Valuation concepts"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Commercial risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Legal research platforms"},{"text":"Data rooms"},{"text":"Contract management"},{"text":"AI-assisted legal research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2+ M&A case studies"},{"text":"1 due-diligence simulation"},{"text":"1 contract-drafting portfolio"},{"text":"1 transaction checklist"},{"text":"Legal research papers"},{"text":"Multiple corporate-law internships"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"LL.B."},{"t